{
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
 "info": {
  "title": "bolo",
  "description": "\nbolo serves speech-to-text, text-to-speech and voice-activity detection.\n\n* **openai** - drop-in `/v1/audio/*` and `/v1/models`\n* **speaches** - model-management routes compatible with speaches\n* **native** - `/api/v1/*`: catalog, pulls, stats, request traces, events, benchmark\n* WebSockets (not shown by OpenAPI): `/api/v1/stt/stream`, `/api/v1/tts/stream` - see docs/api.md\n",
  "license": {
   "name": "Apache-2.0",
   "url": "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
  },
  "version": "0.2.0"
 },
