    "description": "Returns audio as it is synthesised (chunked transfer).\n\n``response_format``: mp3 (default), opus, aac, flac, wav, pcm, plus the\ntelephony extensions ``mulaw`` and ``alaw`` (8 kHz G.711).\n``stream_format``: ``audio`` (default) or ``sse`` (``speech.audio.delta`` events).",
    "operationId": "create_speech_v1_audio_speech_post",
    "requestBody": {
     "content": {
      "application/json": {
       "schema": {
